 "description": "<p>Electric stimulation is the card this rose vibrator plays that most do not: alongside its ten vibration modes it adds a light electric-shock current at the skin, a pins-and-needles tingle that sharpens every other sensation running through the silicone. The two systems work separately or together, so the shock can stay off entirely on days you only want the familiar rumble.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_a3265c26-86da-4781-930b-dac849b18343_480x480.jpg?v=1689322846\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\"></p>\n<p>The body is medical-grade silicone over an ABS frame — the standard pairing for toys at this level, smooth, odorless and kind to sensitive skin. Ten modes run from gentle pulsations to heavier settings, and the range between them is wide enough that the climb stays interesting.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_26bacd1f-366c-46ef-a900-cba6b7438f8f_480x480.jpg?v=1689322842\"></p>\n<p>Power comes from an internal lithium battery: two and a half hours on the charger buys ninety minutes of play. The IPX7 rating covers full submersion, so shower use and thorough rinsing are both routine.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_a787c8e3-939c-4d24-b7e0-80206cc10968_480x480.jpg?v=1689322833\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10</li>\n<li>Extra: light electric-stimulation sensation</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Battery: rechargeable lithium, 2.5 h charge / 1.5 h play</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_686e8071-3a5b-4554-9eff-3bf0c9a63a9f_480x480.jpg?v=1689322836\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_120603e0-67cf-4b84-bbad-ae0110399d0e_480x480.jpg?v=1689322849\"></p>\n<p>Novelty done carefully — a rose vibrator with one sensation the rest of the shelf does not have.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose vibrator pairing 10 vibration modes with a light electric-stimulation tingle, medical silicone body and IPX7 submersion rating.</p>\n",
